  "question": {
    "text": "A compressive force, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math> is applied at the two ends of a long thin steel rod. It is heated, simultaneously, such that its temperature increases by <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>T</mi></math>. The net change in its length is zero. Let <math><mi>l</mi></math> be the length of the rod, A its area of cross-section, <math><mi>Y</mi></math> its Young&#39;s modulus, and <math><mi>&#945;</mi></math> its coefficient of linear expansion. Then, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>F</mi></math> is equal to:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>l</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>Y</mi><mi>&#945;</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi><mi>T</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>A</mi><mi>&nbsp;Y</mi><mi>α</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>T</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mi>AY</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>α</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>T</mi></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mi>&nbsp;Y</mi><mi>α</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>T</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "B"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Net change in length <math><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><br />Thermal expansion. <math><mrow> <mi>Δ</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow> </math><math><mo>=</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>α</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mo>Y=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>l</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>AY</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>l</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>AY</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mi>F</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>AY</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>l</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>α</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></math><br /><br /><math><mi>F</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>AY</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi>α</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Δ</mi><mi>t</mi></math>"
  }
